  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Pair: {傷|いた}める (transitive). Pattern: Xが{傷|いた}む.\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {痛|いた}む - to hurt, to ache\n- {傷|いた}む - to be damaged, to spoil (this entry)\n\nASPECT: ている indicates a current state of being damaged/spoiled.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {髪|かみ}が{傷|いた}む (hair becomes damaged)\n- {食|た}べ{物|もの}が{傷|いた}む (food spoils)\n- {傷|いた}みやすい (easily damaged/perishable)",
